# Tests inherit the strict root config, minus two checks that the test
# infrastructure trips by design:
#   throwing-static-initialization: TEST_CASE registers cases through static
#     registrar objects (allocation at static init is intended).
#   inconsistent-declaration-parameter-name: alloc_test.cpp replaces global
#     operator new, whose standard-library declaration uses reserved names.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,-readability-inconsistent-declaration-parameter-name'
